    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n14 Rosslyn is a beautifully presented and thoughtfully modernised home, enjoying an enviable position within this attractive and highly convenient development. Surrounded by mature trees and greenery, the property offers a wonderful sense of privacy while being just moments from the heart of Bray.\n\nLovingly maintained by the current owners, No. 14 is presented in excellent condition throughout, with a number of recent improvements adding to the comfort and appeal of the home. These include a new gas boiler installed in 2023, upgraded flooring throughout and full redecoration, creating a bright, fresh and contemporary interior.\n\nThe accommodation is both spacious and light-filled. A welcoming entrance hallway sets the tone and leads through to a wonderful living and dining room. The living area strikes the perfect balance between comfort and space, with a wood-burning stove creating a warm and inviting atmosphere, while the dual-aspect layout ensures the room remains wonderfully bright and airy. Generous windows allow natural light to flow through the space while providing a pleasant outlook over the garden. The kitchen is positioned to the rear with direct access to the private south-facing garden. This secluded outdoor space is a particular highlight of the property, enjoying excellent natural light and providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. Ample parking further adds to the practicality of this appealing home. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises two well-proportioned double bedrooms and a single bedroom, together with a fully renovated bathroom, finished in a fresh and contemporary style.\n\nRosslyn enjoys an outstanding location within Bray, just a short stroll from the Town Hall and bustling Main Street, with an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities close at hand.\n\nBray offers an exceptional lifestyle, combining the convenience of a thriving town with the sea, mountains and countryside all within easy reach. The seafront, promenade and beach provide wonderful opportunities for walking and recreation, while the surrounding area caters for a wide range of sporting and leisure interests including golf, sailing, water sports, tennis, rugby, soccer, yoga and Pilates.\n\nFor commuters, Bray is conveniently located less than 20km south of Dublin City Centre and is well served by DART, rail and Dublin Bus services. The M11 and M50 are also within easy reach, providing convenient access to Dublin and the wider road network.\n\nWith its three well propostioned bedrooms, south-facing garden, bright and spacious accommodation, tasteful modernisation and superb central location, 14 Rosslyn represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a welcoming home in one of Bray's most convenient and established residential settings.\n\nKey Features: \n• Turnkey Three bedroom home presented in excellent condition throughout\n• Recent upgrades including a new combi gas boiler (2023), fully renovated bathroom, upgraded flooring and redecoration\n• Bright dual-aspect living/dining area with a cosy wood-burning stove\n• Private south-facing rear garden and two well-proportioned double bedrooms\n• Superb central Bray location, within a short stroll of Main Street and all local amenities\n• Excellent transport links including DART, rail and Dublin Bus services\n• Easy access to the M11 and M50, ideal for commuting to Dublin and beyond\n• Bray seafront, beach and promenade all within easy reach"
      },
